flowchart LR
    subgraph Source
        Push([git push]) --> Hook{Webhook}
    end
    subgraph CI [Continuous integration]
        Lint[Lint] --> Test[Unit tests]
        Test --> Build[Build image]
    end
    subgraph CD [Delivery]
        Stage[(Staging)] --> Smoke{Smoke tests}
        Smoke -->|pass| Prod((Production))
        Smoke -->|fail| Rollback[Rollback]
    end
    Hook -->|main| Lint
    Build ==> Stage
    Rollback -.-> Stage
